{"id":"2aab8d6d79a93409","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-atm-accept.md","title":"ATM接受","display":"df-atm-accept — ATM接受","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-atm-accept","aliases":["29-df-atm-accept"],"display":"df-atm-accept — ATM接受","depends_on":["[[29-df-atm]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 2.24, p.35, DjVu scan 50"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-atm-accept"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-atm-accept</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atm-accept — ATM接受"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"77e57ed488a01e39\" href=\"?note=77e57ed488a01e39\" title=\"29-df-atm\">29-df-atm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 2.24, p.35, DjVu scan 50"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\)</span> 为其底层标准机器的配置集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_M:\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\to Q_M\">\\(q_M:\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\to Q_M\\)</span> 为状态投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Conf}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\)</span> 为有限的合法一步后继集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{start}_M(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{start}_M(x)\\)</span> 是二进制输入串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 上的初始配置；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M\">\\(Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"77e57ed488a01e39\" href=\"?note=77e57ed488a01e39\" title=\"29-df-atm\">29-df-atm</a> 的机器数据确定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_M(X)\\coloneqq\\{c\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\mid q_M(c)=q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M\\lor(q_M(c)\\in Q_\\exists\\land\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\cap X\\ne\\varnothing)\\lor(q_M(c)\\in Q_\\forall\\land\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\subseteq X)\\},\\quad X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Conf}_M.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_M(X)\\coloneqq\\{c\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\mid q_M(c)=q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M\\lor(q_M(c)\\in Q_\\exists\\land\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\cap X\\ne\\varnothing)\\lor(q_M(c)\\in Q_\\forall\\land\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\subseteq X)\\},\\quad X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Conf}_M.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_M^0\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad X_M^{j+1}\\coloneqq F_M(X_M^j),\\quad\\mathrm{Acc}_M\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}X_M^j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_M^0\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad X_M^{j+1}\\coloneqq F_M(X_M^j),\\quad\\mathrm{Acc}_M\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}X_M^j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Accepts}(M,x)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{start}_M(x)\\in\\mathrm{Acc}_M.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Accepts}(M,x)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{start}_M(x)\\in\\mathrm{Acc}_M.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 2.24 的三条接受规则。算子单调且后继有限，因此有限阶段的并为其最小不动点；一个配置加入当且仅当具有有限接受推导树。无后继的全称状态不因空全称量词自动接受，遵循原书的非空后继条件。现在显式提供下游原先调用却不存在的 Accepts(M,x)，并闭合配置、状态和后继的机器参数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-atm","status":"resolved","id":"77e57ed488a01e39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-atm]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atm","status":"resolved","id":"77e57ed488a01e39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{start}_M(x)$ 是二进制输入串 $x$ 上的初始配置；$Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M$ 由 [[29-df-atm]] 的机器数据确定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"q_M:\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\to Q_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{start}_M(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M","display":false},{"tex":"F_M(X)\\coloneqq\\{c\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\mid q_M(c)=q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M\\lor(q_M(c)\\in Q_\\exists\\land\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\cap X\\ne\\varnothing)\\lor(q_M(c)\\in Q_\\forall\\land\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)\\subseteq X)\\},\\quad X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Conf}_M.","display":true},{"tex":"X_M^0\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad X_M^{j+1}\\coloneqq F_M(X_M^j),\\quad\\mathrm{Acc}_M\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}X_M^j.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Accepts}(M,x)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{start}_M(x)\\in\\mathrm{Acc}_M.","display":true}],"bytes":1640,"backlinks":[{"id":"8a781a879eb2b5bf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"77e57ed488a01e39","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Definition 2.24，印刷页35、扫描页50。此前只写一个未分型的元组，未定义后续使用的机器集合 ATM，且状态划分可重叠。现将内部有限描述机器与新增交替标记分开。随机访问只读输入依原书本页约定；输入带不计入工作空间。接受的归纳语义见 [[29-df-atm-accept]]。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-atm]]、[[29-df-atm-accept]] — 交替图灵机及接受语义"},{"id":"9120c20ece14d350","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为固定有限输入词汇；$x_{A,<},n_A,\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S),\\operatorname{Time}_M(x)$ 采用 [[29-df-alt-complexity]]，$\\operatorname{Accepts}$ 采用 [[29-df-atm-accept]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-atm-accept]]"}],"outgoing":["77e57ed488a01e39"]}